BT /F1 14.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 773.20 Td (Section 1: Governance) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 743.22 Td (The sections below follow the order in which customers usually ask their questions.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 712.04 Td (A written security policy covers all staff, and management approval is renewed at each) Tj ET
BT 59.53 696.45 Td (annual policy review.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 665.27 Td (The Chief Information Security Officer is accountable for information security and leads) Tj ET
BT 59.53 649.68 Td (a dedicated security team.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 618.50 Td (Risk assessment is carried out ad hoc, and a risk register is being rolled out for risk) Tj ET
BT 59.53 602.91 Td (management.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 571.72 Td (The company was founded to make routine work easier for its customers.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
BT 236.72 33.03 Td (Quillfield Analytics - Page 2 of ) Tj (9) Tj ET

