BT /F1 14.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 773.20 Td (Section 2: Access) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 743.22 Td (Accounts for new staff are created on their first day at the company.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 712.04 Td (Every access request is approved by the data owner on a need to know basis, and RBAC) Tj ET
BT 59.53 696.45 Td (groups define standard permissions.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 665.27 Td (Multi-factor authentication is mandatory for all staff, administrators and remote) Tj ET
BT 59.53 649.68 Td (access, and single sign-on is required for production tools.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 618.50 Td (Admin access uses a break-glass procedure, and elevated privileges are granted only for) Tj ET
BT 59.53 602.91 Td (the time needed.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 571.72 Td (An access review takes place once a year, and deprovisioning is handled manually for) Tj ET
BT 59.53 556.13 Td (some systems.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 524.95 Td (Employees can reset forgotten passwords through the self-service page.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
BT 236.72 33.03 Td (Quillfield Analytics - Page 3 of ) Tj (9) Tj ET

endstream
