BT /F1 14.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 773.20 Td (Section 4: Operations) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 743.22 Td (The operations group looks after servers, databases and the tools that keep the service) Tj ET
BT 59.53 727.63 Td (running.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 696.45 Td (Security-relevant events are sent to a central SIEM for logging, and audit logs are kept) Tj ET
BT 59.53 680.86 Td (for twelve months under our log retention rule.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 649.68 Td (A patch management process applies updates monthly, and every CVE rated critical is) Tj ET
BT 59.53 634.09 Td (tracked until closed.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 602.91 Td (A penetration test is not performed, and no independent security testing takes place.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 571.72 Td (A firewall protects the production network, and network segmentation is being rolled out) Tj ET
BT 59.53 556.13 Td (between environments.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 524.95 Td (Servers are located in modern facilities with reliable power and cooling.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
BT 236.72 33.03 Td (Quillfield Analytics - Page 5 of ) Tj (9) Tj ET

