BT /F1 14.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 773.20 Td (Section 5: Resilience) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 743.22 Td (Customers can follow the service status on a public page.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 712.04 Td (A documented incident response plan defines roles and severity levels, and a tabletop) Tj ET
BT 59.53 696.45 Td (exercise tests it every year.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 665.27 Td (The company does not commit to notify customers of a data breach within a set time.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 634.09 Td (Staff are encouraged to keep their emergency contact details up to date.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
BT 236.72 33.03 Td (Quillfield Analytics - Page 6 of ) Tj (9) Tj ET

