BT 59.53 773.20 Td (Section 6: Engineering) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 743.22 Td (Engineers use modern programming languages and shared libraries.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 712.04 Td (Software follows a secure development lifecycle in which every change gets a code review) Tj ET
BT 59.53 696.45 Td (and SAST runs in the pipeline.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 665.27 Td (Change approval is required for major releases, and rollback is tested ad hoc.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 634.09 Td (The engineering group meets every Monday to discuss the week.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
BT 236.72 33.03 Td (Quillfield Analytics - Page 7 of ) Tj (9) Tj ET

